 "summary": "MaxIterationsExceededException in SVD (EigenDecompositionImpl.findEigenVectors ) caused by NaN"
 "description": "In the following code fragment from EigenDecompositionImpl.findEigenVectors \n....................................................................  \n for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {  \n int its = 0;  \n int m;  \n do {  \n for (m = j; m < n - 1; m++) {  \n double delta = Math.abs(realEigenvalues[m]) + Math.abs(realEigenvalues[m + 1]);  \n if (Math.abs(e[m]) + delta == delta) \n{\n break;\n }  \n }  \n if (m != j) {  \n .........................................  \nthe test for \"(Math.abs(e[m]) + delta == delta)\" is not executed when m is equal to n -1. As a result e[m] == 0 (does happen!) causes variables q and realEigenvalues[m] to become NaN that in turn causes \"Math.abs(e[m]) + delta == delta)\" to become always false."
}
